{
 "0001": {
  "title": "",
  "nodes": [
   {
    "id": "h4_00001",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     11
    ],
    "text": "[A1][/A1]NAME",
    "placeholders": {
     "A1": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_306_01\" id=\"tag_17_306_01\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "blockquote_00002",
    "type": "blockquote",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     13
    ],
    "text": "listen — listen for socket connections and limit the queue of incoming connections",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00003",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     15
    ],
    "text": "[A2][/A2]SYNOPSIS",
    "placeholders": {
     "A2": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_306_02\" id=\"tag_17_306_02\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00004",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     17,
     1
    ],
    "text": "[CODE3]",
    "placeholders": {
     "CODE3": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<code><tt>#include &lt;<a href=\"../basedefs/sys_socket.h.html\">sys/socket.h</a>&gt;<br>\n<br>\nint listen(int</tt> <i>socket</i><tt>, int</tt> <i>backlog</i><tt>);<br></tt></code>"
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00005",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     19
    ],
    "text": "[A4][/A4]DESCRIPTION",
    "placeholders": {
     "A4": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_306_03\" id=\"tag_17_306_03\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00006",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The [I5]listen[/I5]() function shall mark a connection-mode socket, specified by the [I6]socket[/I6] argument, as accepting\nconnections.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I5": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I6": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00007",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     3
    ],
    "text": "The [I7]backlog[/I7] argument provides a hint to the implementation which the implementation shall use to limit the number of\noutstanding connections in the socket's listen queue. Implementations may impose a limit on [I8]backlog[/I8] and silently reduce the\nspecified value. Normally, a larger [I9]backlog[/I9] argument value shall result in a larger or equal length of the listen queue.\nImplementations shall support values of [I10]backlog[/I10] up to SOMAXCONN, defined in [A11][I12]&lt;sys/socket.h&gt;[/I12][/A11].",
    "placeholders": {
     "I7": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I8": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I9": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I10": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A11": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../basedefs/sys_socket.h.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I12": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00008",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     5
    ],
    "text": "The implementation may include incomplete connections in its listen queue. The limits on the number of incomplete connections\nand completed connections queued may be different.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00009",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     7
    ],
    "text": "The implementation may have an upper limit on the length of the listen queue—either global or per accepting socket. If\n[I13]backlog[/I13] exceeds this limit, the length of the listen queue is set to the limit.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I13": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00010",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     9
    ],
    "text": "If [I14]listen[/I14]() is called with a [I15]backlog[/I15] argument value that is less than 0, the function behaves as if it had been\ncalled with a [I16]backlog[/I16] argument value of 0.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I14": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I15": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I16": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00011",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     11
    ],
    "text": "A [I17]backlog[/I17] argument of 0 may allow the socket to accept connections, in which case the length of the listen queue may be\nset to an implementation-defined minimum value.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I17": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00012",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     13
    ],
    "text": "The socket in use may require the process to have appropriate privileges to use the [I18]listen[/I18]() function.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I18": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00013",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     23
    ],
    "text": "[A19][/A19]RETURN VALUE",
    "placeholders": {
     "A19": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_306_04\" id=\"tag_17_306_04\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00014",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     25,
     1
    ],
    "text": "Upon successful completions, [I20]listen[/I20]() shall return 0; otherwise, -1 shall be returned and [I21]errno[/I21] set to indicate\nthe error.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I20": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I21": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00015",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     27
    ],
    "text": "[A22][/A22]ERRORS",
    "placeholders": {
     "A22": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_306_05\" id=\"tag_17_306_05\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00016",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The [I23]listen[/I23]() function shall fail if:",
    "placeholders": {
     "I23": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00017",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     3
    ],
    "text": "[EBADF]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00018",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     5
    ],
    "text": "The [I24]socket[/I24] argument is not a valid file descriptor.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I24": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00019",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     7
    ],
    "text": "[EDESTADDRREQ]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00020",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     9
    ],
    "text": "The socket is not bound to a local address, and the protocol does not support listening on an unbound socket.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00021",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     11
    ],
    "text": "[EINVAL]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00022",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     13
    ],
    "text": "The [I25]socket[/I25] is already connected.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I25": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00023",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     15
    ],
    "text": "[ENOTSOCK]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00024",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     17
    ],
    "text": "The [I26]socket[/I26] argument does not refer to a socket.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I26": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00025",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     19
    ],
    "text": "[EOPNOTSUPP]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00026",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     3,
     21
    ],
    "text": "The socket protocol does not support [I27]listen[/I27]().",
    "placeholders": {
     "I27": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00027",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     5
    ],
    "text": "The [I28]listen[/I28]() function may fail if:",
    "placeholders": {
     "I28": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00028",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     7,
     3
    ],
    "text": "[EACCES]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00029",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     7,
     5
    ],
    "text": "The calling process does not have appropriate privileges.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00030",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     7,
     7
    ],
    "text": "[EINVAL]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00031",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     7,
     9
    ],
    "text": "The [I29]socket[/I29] has been shut down.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I29": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00032",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     7,
     11
    ],
    "text": "[ENOBUFS]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00033",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     7,
     13
    ],
    "text": "Insufficient resources are available in the system to complete the call.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
